==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|<,,ran,run>}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[take]] someone home by [[car]]; to give someone a [[lift]] to their house.
#: {{ux|en|If you can wait a couple of minutes, I'll '''run''' you '''back'''.}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[rewind]] a film or [[cassette]].
#: {{ux|en|Can you '''run''' it '''back''' to the beginning, please?}}
# {{lb|en|informal|idiomatic}} To [[revisit]], [[repeat]], or [[do over|do something over]].
#: {{ux|en|Wait, I didn't catch what you just said. '''Run''' it '''back''' for me, please.}}
# {{&lit|en|run|back}}

